steamid": "76561198119970643", "personaname": "Garry", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/garrykhossman/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 12952, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12053, "last_played": 1537397542, "avatar": "73fb36565ef24884ae233c740efaf729c6803034"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is far more than the sum of its parts. I came from dayz....a game thats based on the arma engine and was blown away by how more beautiful this game is. Altis{i like it} is a massive map that you can lose yourself in even on a 65 man server. Arma 3 has morphed into a more interesting game with the ability to use mods made by the community Exile,breaking point and Epoch being some of them. I would thoroughly recommend this game. Ive played over 200 hrs and havent even scratched the surface.....", "timestamp_created": 1446328556, "timestamp_updated": 1446329105, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "18801595", "author": {"steamid": "76561198140988097", "personaname": "The Outlaw Texas Red", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198140988097/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 147318, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 33856, "last_played": 1781843666, "avatar": "22bbf9fdf210964771ef4a2933be50b009613b33"}, "language": "english", "review": "Perhaps the Glitchiest game on steam. And one of the most fun. you will want to rip out your fingernails at all the ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ deaths and random crashes but somewhere in there you will find the reason you paid for this game. 10\\10 best Door suicide simulator available.", "timestamp_